  "title": "Chinook | Warehouse Integrity & SCD2 — کیفیت انبار داده و تاریخچه مشتریان",
  "description": "Warehouse integrity monitoring backed by ChinookDW in ClickHouse. All anomaly checks scan full warehouse history. Only the Fact Rows KPI follows the Grafana date filter. SCD temporal linkage uses calendar-day granularity because FactSales references DimDate via DateKey; it cannot prove within-day timestamp alignment. These are checks for a sample Chinook project, not a production certification.",
